          "id": 643437044,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "At the time of writing this change I struggled with these two lines. When there is no ZLIB available content_encoding_str will not be used (atm). => So, yes it is an unused variable.\n\nBut in theory there could be another non-zip-related encoding which needs further decoding (in the future). For me it's totally okay to use `#ifdef HAVE_ZLIB` for now.",
